unt":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4785497374,"name":"BEAR*","desc":"Join the BEAR* Group to redeem Daily Rewards!\n\nBear is a vicious, all devouring entity that overran the world faster than anyone could've anticipated. Bear only needs to get lucky once, while you must get lucky every single time.\n\nCONTROLS\nSprinting - (Keyboard - Shift) (Controller - B)\nFlashlight - (Keyboard - F) (Controller - X)\nCrouching - (Keyboard - C) (Controller - Left Thumbstick Tap)\n\nBEAR* 2020-2023\nPiloted by Cheedaman and Croutonium.","path":"/game/4785497374-bear","slug":"4785497374-bear","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ab3b4bd039bac903fea0344ad9c46966d827a540c81533b67824a5ba49eb901.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-57618e95aa06b8d33bc59fe60e982d58/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":24,"visitor":62555388,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T06:58:12.775Z","creator":{"name":"Cheedaman","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":101451125,"name":"FLIGHTLINE - Open Beta","desc":"BETA 4 (0.4.93)\n\n+ Flight plans can now be edited during flight\n+ The ILS can now be configured from any aircraft view\n+ A completely new top-bar menu experience is being tested in this version\n+ Quick Actions have been integrated into the top-bar menu (minus the throttle quadrant panel)\n+ Various improvements have been made to the camera system\n+ The camera system now considers the last click position as its datum, rather than the center of the screen (where applicable)\n+ Users can now move the camera closer or further from the subject by scrolling while holding down the Left Control key\n+ Autopilot accuracy has been slightly improved while approach mode is engaged\n+ Autopilot pitch commands now better compensate for banked turns\n+ Flight level change mode (FLCH) has been added to the autopilot\n+ A dedicated approach mode switch (APPR) has been added to the autopilot\n\n...\nFull update logs are available in Community Server.","path":"/game/101451125-flightline","slug":"101451125-flightline","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/23479b14399c72141a0eb04395769f82954271b618c86650418c7f2af196d70f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-191f081a3ee028a9f9d8e72566f702f0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":24,"visitor":20451679,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-08-16T21:31:19.167Z","creator":{"name":"JayManLive","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13100646976,"name":"ARCHEMARA [EARLY ACCESS]","desc":"Archemara is a combat-intensive co-op PVE dungeon crawler.\n\nArchemara is currently in Early Access, your patience with any encountered bug or inconvenience is greatly appreciated!\n\nMAIN CONTROLS\nX - Draw & holster\nF - Healing flask\nTab - Index Menu & close menus\nM1 - Primary moveset\nM1 + Shift - Secondary moveset\nM1 + Ctrl - Tertiary moveset\nM2 - Block & Parry\nMMB - Target lock-on\nSpace - Dodge\n\nAll roadmaps, patch notes, & discussions are held in the Battle Core Games server.\nOur community: https://www.roblox.com/share/g/32941830\n\nDeveloped under Battle Core Games Ltd. Co.\nInspired by Davidii's Heroes!, Dark Souls 3, Monster Hunter & Warframe.\n\nMany things to come.","path":"/game/13100646976-archemara","slug":"13100646976-archemara","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4a98b0606a8813e590946b106c87a91b05bc8d6dc8ff90c1bfb30217789ac6e1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d3fb444528ff112645d770fea6efb271/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":24,"visitor":4853366,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-05T20:42:00.875Z","creator":{"name":"BrotatoChipler","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17794872486,"name":"Rich Mansion Tycoon!  🤑","desc":"","path":"/game/17794872486-rich-mansion-tycoon","slug":"17794872486-rich-mansion-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cae82f7d7b779bc4962511be5cc0d3417252150c5be27b6f7a24d7d5a6601947